# SOII v0.1 — RMAL-facing contract

LANGUAGE SOII_RMAL SURFACES canonical,user-native BACKENDS object,bytecode,ir-json,human

TYPE SOIIPacket BASE Value
TYPE SOIIEndpoint BASE Value
TYPE SOIISemanticLedger BASE Value
TYPE SOIITransition BASE Value
TYPE SOIIWitness BASE Value
TYPE SOIIResult BASE Value

TRAIT SOIIReconstructible REQUIRE provenance remainder evidence
TRAIT SOIIWitnessed REQUIRE witness scope

PRESERVE RMAL_SOL_Distinction
PRESERVE Surface_Semantics_Distinction
PRESERVE Input_Identity
PRESERVE Evidence_NoSilentStrengthening
PRESERVE Failure_NoSilentDeletion
PRESERVE Remainder_NoSilentDeletion
PRESERVE Authority_ExplicitTransfer
PRESERVE Provenance_Lineage

CONTEXT SOII role="shared_operational_interleaved_interlingua" version="0.1" truth_authority="none"
CONTEXT SOII_RMAL_Profile producer="RMAL" peer="SOL" evidence_transfer="deny" authority_transfer="explicit"

RELATION SOIIHandoff ALLOW SOIIPacket SOIIPacket DENY evidence_transfer authority_transfer
RELATION SOIIWitnesses ALLOW SOIIWitness SOIITransition DENY truth_promotion
RELATION SOIICarries ALLOW SOIIPacket SOIISemanticLedger DENY semantic_collapse

OPERATOR SOIIEncodeRMAL BIND SOIIPacket INPUT SOIISemanticLedger OUTPUT SOIIPacket EFFECT representation AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance evidence remainder failures authority
OPERATOR SOIIDecodeToRMAL BIND SOIISemanticLedger INPUT SOIIPacket OUTPUT SOIISemanticLedger EFFECT representation AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance evidence remainder failures authority
OPERATOR SOIIVerifyTransition BIND SOIITransition INPUT SOIIPacket SOIIPacket OUTPUT SOIIResult EFFECT verify AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance failures remainder evidence authority
OPERATOR SOIIResolveRemainder BIND SOIITransition INPUT SOIIPacket SOIIWitness OUTPUT SOIIPacket EFFECT repair AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance resolution_witness
OPERATOR SOIITransferAuthority BIND SOIITransition INPUT SOIIPacket SOIIWitness OUTPUT SOIIPacket EFFECT route AUTHORITY user PRESERVE provenance transfer_witness
OPERATOR SOIIHandoffToSOL BIND SOIIPacket INPUT SOIIPacket OUTPUT SOIIPacket EFFECT route AUTHORITY none PRESERVE provenance evidence remainder failures authority

RULE SOII_R01 IF "surface changes from RMAL to SOL" THEN "preserve the typed semantic ledger"
RULE SOII_R02 IF "existing evidence changes" THEN "require an explicit evidence-change witness"
RULE SOII_R03 IF "a failure would disappear" THEN "reject the transition"
RULE SOII_R04 IF "a remainder item disappears" THEN "require an explicit resolution witness"
RULE SOII_R05 IF "authority changes" THEN "require explicit authority-transfer witness"
RULE SOII_R06 IF "the frozen input changes" THEN "reject the transition and start a new input lineage"
RULE SOII_R07 IF "two surfaces map to one packet" THEN "do not infer global semantic equivalence"
RULE SOII_R08 IF "the next producer is not the previous consumer" THEN "reject the interleave"

CLAIM SOII_C01 STATUS BOUNDED_CLAIM TEXT "SOII carries a typed operational ledger between RMAL and SOL without granting either surface automatic truth or evidence authority."
COUNTERPROBE "Can a packet silently promote evidence, erase failure, erase remainder, or transfer authority?"
VERIFY "SOII preserves input, evidence lineage, failure lineage, unresolved remainder, provenance and explicit authority boundaries."